CM_ "DRAFT can2gauge DBC: ECUMaster EMU Black CAN stream (base ID default 0x600, movable). Written from the published layout, not copied from any maker DBC. Gauge-unit conversions (kPa->mbar/bar, K->C) are done by the gauge.";
CM_ BO_ 1536 "Source: EMU Black manual doc 1.4 (fw 2.169+) ch.6 CAN Stream. Rate not documented.";
CM_ SG_ 1536 TPS "Manual: TPS 0-100 %, 0.5 %/bit. On a drive-by-wire setup this may be the pedal rather than the blade (DBW position is on base+5) - UNVERIFIED which.";
CM_ SG_ 1536 MAP "Absolute, kPa (gauge 'map' is mbar: x10).";
CM_ SG_ 1536 InjectorPW "Manual multiplier 1/62.";
CM_ BO_ 1537 "Source: EMU Black manual doc 1.4 (fw 2.169+) ch.6 CAN Stream.";
CM_ BO_ 1538 "Source: EMU Black manual doc 1.4 (fw 2.169+) ch.6 CAN Stream.";
CM_ SG_ 1538 Baro "50-130 kPa. Good fingerprint byte: sits near 95-103 at sea level.";
CM_ SG_ 1538 OilTemp "Manual: 8-bit unsigned 0-160 C (cannot show below 0 C).";
CM_ BO_ 1539 "Source: EMU Black manual doc 1.4 (fw 2.169+) ch.6 CAN Stream.";
CM_ SG_ 1539 Lambda "Manual multiplier 1/128.";
CM_ SG_ 1539 LambdaCorrection "75-125 %, 100 = no correction.";
CM_ BO_ 1540 "Source: EMU Black manual doc 1.4 (fw 2.169+) ch.6 CAN Stream.";
CM_ SG_ 1540 Gear "Manual: 8-bit unsigned 0-7. ECUMaster forum (2025) notes the calibration runs -1..7, so reverse may arrive as 255 - UNVERIFIED (no label given for it on purpose).";
CM_ SG_ 1540 ERR_FPR "Error Flag bit 10: fuel pressure relative error.";
CM_ BO_ 1541 "Source: EMU Black manual doc 1.4 (fw 2.169+) ch.6 CAN Stream.";
CM_ BO_ 1542 "Source: EMU Black manual doc 1.4 (fw 2.169+) ch.6 CAN Stream.";
CM_ SG_ 1542 OUTFLAGS1 "Bits: 0-4 parametric outputs 1-5, 5-7 virtual outputs 1-3.";
CM_ SG_ 1542 OUTFLAGS2 "Bits 0-7: CAN switches 1-8.";
CM_ SG_ 1542 OUTFLAGS3 "Bits: 0-2 switches 1-3, 3-5 mux switches 1-3, 6 launch map set, 7 ALS map set.";
CM_ SG_ 1542 OUTFLAGS4 "Bits: 0 fuel pump, 1 coolant fan, 2 AC clutch, 3 AC fan, 4 nitrous, 5 starter request, 6 boost map set.";
CM_ BO_ 1543 "Source: EMU Black manual doc 1.4 (fw 2.169+) ch.6 CAN Stream. Community EMUcan library: bytes 4-7 only sent since EMU fw 'version 143' (shorter frame before) - UNVERIFIED.";
CM_ SG_ 1543 DSGMode "Manual: 4-bit enumeration in byte 3 (2=P 3=R 4=N 5=D 6=S 7=M 15=fault). Which nibble is not stated: low nibble assumed; EMUcan reads the whole byte - UNVERIFIED.";
BA_DEF_ SG_ "GaugeKey" STRING ;
BA_DEF_ SG_ "GaugePriority" INT 0 9;
BA_DEF_ "GaugeRelocatable" INT 0 1;
BA_DEF_ "GaugeBusSpeed" INT 0 1000000;
